# Reference values from OrdinaryDiffEqAMF (AMF around Rosenbrock23, Rodas4
# and Rodas5P of OrdinaryDiffEqRosenbrock), generated by tools/amf-probe.jl:
# points, nf, njacs, nw, nsolve, naccept, nreject and the final state of
# du/dt = (A1 + A2) u - u^3 + (0.1 t, 0, 0, 0) with the Jacobian split into
# the upper triangular A1 and the lower triangular A2 - 3 diag(u^2):
# the AMF product (split and prebuilt factors), the exact W (jac only), the
# split with an event halving the state at t = 1/2 (cb), and a three way
# split of (S + T) u - u^3 + (0.1 t, 0, 0, 0) into a symmetric, a
# tridiagonal and a diagonal part (sym).

amf_A1 <- rbind(c(-3, 1, 0.5, 0), c(0, -2, 0.25, 1), c(0, 0, -4, 0.5), c(0, 0, 0, -1))
amf_A2 <- rbind(c(0, 0, 0, 0), c(0.5, 0, 0, 0), c(0.25, 1, 0, 0), c(0, 0.5, 0.25, 0))
amf_AA <- amf_A1 + amf_A2
amf_f <- function(u, p, t) {
  du <- as.numeric(amf_AA %*% u) - u * u * u
  du[1] <- du[1] + 0.1 * t
  du
}
amf_upd2 <- function(A, u, p, t) amf_A2 - diag(3 * u * u)
amf_u0 <- c(1, 0.5, -0.25, 0.75)
amf_fun <- function(form) {
  J1 <- MatrixOperator(amf_A1)
  J2 <- MatrixOperator(amf_A2, amf_upd2)
  Jop <- cache_operator(J1 + J2, numeric(4))
  if (form == "split") return(build_amf_function(amf_f, jac = Jop, split = list(J1, J2)))
  if (form == "jac") return(build_amf_function(amf_f, jac = Jop))
  g <- function() ScalarOperator(1, function(a, u, p, t, gamma = 1) gamma)
  build_amf_function(amf_f, jac = Jop,
                     amf_factors = list(IdentityOperator(4) - g() * J1, IdentityOperator(4) - g() * J2))
}
amf_S <- rbind(c(-4, 1, 0.5, 0.25), c(1, -3, 0.5, 0), c(0.5, 0.5, -5, 1), c(0.25, 0, 1, -2))
amf_T <- rbind(c(-1, 0.5, 0, 0), c(0.25, -1, 0.5, 0), c(0, 0.25, -1, 0.5), c(0, 0, 0.25, -1))
amf_ST <- amf_S + amf_T
amf_g <- function(u, p, t) {
  du <- as.numeric(amf_ST %*% u) - u * u * u
  du[1] <- du[1] + 0.1 * t
  du
}
amf_fun3 <- function() {
  JS <- MatrixOperator(amf_S)
  JT <- MatrixOperator(amf_T)
  JD <- MatrixOperator(matrix(0, 4, 4), function(A, u, p, t) diag(-3 * u * u))
  build_amf_function(amf_g, jac = cache_operator(JS + JT + JD, numeric(4)), split = list(JS, JT, JD))
}
